---
---
<section class="section-light section-pad" aria-label="About Banco">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-grid">
      <!-- Left: sticky label + headline -->
      <div class="intro-left">
        <div class="eyebrow">Integrated manufacturer</div>
        <h2 class="t-h2" style="color:var(--color-navy);margin-top:20px">
          Full value chain.<br/>
          <em class="accent">One source.</em>
        </h2>
        <div style="margin-top:32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
          <span class="pill">ISO 9001</span>
          <span class="pill">IATF 16949</span>
          <span class="pill">CE</span>
          <span class="pill">CBAM</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: copy + stat strip -->
      <div class="intro-right">
        <p class="t-lead" style="color:var(--color-stone-700)">
          Banco Aluminium is an integrated aluminium extrusion company established in
          Vadodara, Gujarat in 1967 — and still family-owned. We own every step from
          billet casting through to finished profile, giving industrial buyers and
          architectural specifiers a single point of accountability for quality,
          delivery, and development.
        </p>
        <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--color-stone-700);margin-top:16px">
          Stronger control over alloy quality, profile development, dimensional accuracy,
          mechanical properties, processing timelines, surface finish and final product
          consistency — this is what full vertical integration delivers, and it is the
          reason that 1,100+ customers across four export regions return to Banco for
          their critical aluminium requirements.
        </p>
        <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--color-stone-700);margin-top:16px">
          Our CBAM-certified carbon footprint of 0.763 kg CO₂e per kilogram of aluminium
          — achieved through natural gas melting, 960 kW captive solar, and up to 50%
          recycled scrap input — is among the lowest in our class, and fully documented
          for European import compliance.
        </p>

        <!-- Stat strip -->
        <div class="stat-strip">
          <div class="stat-strip-cell">
            <div class="ssn">55,000<span class="ssu"> MT</span></div>
            <div class="ssl">Foundry capacity / yr</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-strip-cell">
            <div class="ssn">5<span class="ssu"> presses</span></div>
            <div class="ssl">1,100 – 3,300 MT range</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-strip-cell">
            <div class="ssn">1xxx–7xxx</div>
            <div class="ssl">Alloy series</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-strip-cell">
            <div class="ssn">0.763<span class="ssu"> kg</span></div>
            <div class="ssl">CO₂e / kg · CBAM certified</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
